      "question": "Read the extract and answer the questions.\n\n*Belinda lived in a little white house,*\n*With a little black kitten and a little grey mouse,*\n*And a little yellow dog and a little pet dragon.*\n\n(i) Name the poem.\n\n(ii) What is the name of the kitten?\n\n(iii) What is the name of the dragon?\n\n(iv) Which word is repeated?\n\n(v) What is the rhyme scheme?",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "answer_steps": [
        "(i) The Tale of Custard the Dragon.",
        "(ii) Ink.",
        "(iii) Custard.",
        "(iv) 'little'.",
        "(v) aabb (couplets)."
      ],
      "marking_scheme": [
